        "body": "V2X Aerospace has $1.4B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. V2X Aerospace received 97 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $14M. Obligations fell 11.7% year over year. FY26 is a partial fiscal-year total."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the top buyers and what markets does V2X Aerospace serve?",
        "body": "The Department of Defense is the top buyer at $1B, followed by the General Services Administration at $287M and the Department of Justice at $32.6M. The largest market is Other Support Activities for Air Transportation at $945M, followed by Engineering Services at $333M and Aircraft Manufacturing at $39.2M. V2X Aerospace also sells in All Other Professional, Scientific, and Technical Services at $20.8M and Other Scientific and Technical Consulting Services at $20.1M."
      }
